' created the hole step 2 closes, and step 3 made the leak step 5 closes
' exploitable. Phase 2 (Oct-Nov 2026): four steps over five migrations;
' steps 6 and 8 fixed holes found by probing prod. No final state: the arc
' continues.
' Every state names its migration; see MANIFEST.md (F15) for line numbers.
@startuml f15-security-arc
!include _style.iuml

skinparam ranksep 22
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam state {
  FontSize 10
  AttributeFontSize 10
}

title Privilege-escalation hardening, January to November 2026

state "Phase 1 · January to June" as PH1 #FFFFFF {
